# Redesign review screenshots — kept on disk for review, too heavy for git.
/docs/redesign-screenshots/

# Local media import staging.
#
# The owner drops folders of photographs here to import them. They are
# classroom, fieldwork and family photographs of real people — many of them
# children — and committing them would publish to the repository exactly the
# files the privacy review exists to gate. The folder itself is tracked (via
# the README below) so the path is discoverable; nothing inside it ever is.
/imports/portfolio-media/*
!/imports/portfolio-media/README.md

# Feature review screenshots — kept on disk for review, too heavy for git.
/docs/experience-photos-screenshots/
/docs/journey-screenshots/
/docs/publications-screenshots/
